  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/lwvgt84cle4.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting Promotional Banner\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">✨ 需要服务器？选择 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fp%252fBigChadGuys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></strong>！✨</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>作为整合包开发者，我使用过许多服务器提供商，但 Bisect 在质量和支持方面脱颖而出。在这个充斥着不道德行为、难以触及的支持和退款拒绝的行业中，Bisect 采取了不同的方法。他们避免了这些陷阱，并将您的满意度放在首位。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">💞 使用代码 <strong>BIGCHADGUYS</strong>&nbsp;首月立减 <strong>25%</strong>！💞</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner1.png\" alt=\"Overview\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">✨ 想象一下 <strong>星露谷物语</strong>&nbsp;遇上 <strong>Pokémon</strong>！✨ <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbigchadguys.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BigChadGuys Plus</a></strong> 是一款舒适温馨的 Cobblemon 冒险整合包，灵感来源于与 Pokémon 共度的日常生活。跳入一个美丽的世界。探索数百种装饰物，从打字机到电视机再到马桶。驾驶飞机、火车和汽车与朋友们竞速。通过大量的农业和烹饪模组丰富你的饮食。在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fselling-bin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Selling Bin</a></strong> 出售你的作物和生物掉落物！并在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaily-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daily Shop</a></strong> 购买稀有且独特的物品！<strong>BCG+</strong> 遵循类似原版 <strong>Minecraft</strong> 的进度系统，在熟悉感中带来令人兴奋的新变化。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner2.png\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<p>✨ <strong>推荐配置为 6GB 至 8GB 内存</strong>：以获得卓越的性能！</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>精美的世界生成</strong>：由 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></strong> 驱动。</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>内置光影</strong>：体验 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary</a></strong> 带来的精美视觉效果。</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>引人入胜的任务</strong>：加入我们全面的任务系统，每一步都充满挑战！</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>单人/多人经济系统</strong>：通过我们定制的 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaily-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daily Shop</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fselling-bin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Selling Bin</a></strong> 驾驭独特的经济体系。释放你内心的资本家&mdash;&mdash;建造庞大的农场，以支持你对小玩意和饰品的无尽追求。</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>飞机、火车和汽车</strong>：探索庞大的载具体系，尽显出行风采！再也不用担心迟到&mdash;&mdash;而且现在，你有了建造那个你一直想要的停车场的完美理由。</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>海量新装饰</strong>：潜入装饰物的宝库！拥有数百种选项，你会不断感到惊讶，心想：<em>天哪，他们居然也有这个？！</em></p>\n<p>✨ <strong>农业与烹饪的全新体验</strong>：准备好探索扩展的美食世界吧！拥有 vast 的食材库，可能性无穷无尽&mdash;&mdash;从制作寿司卷到烘烤披萨，甚至制作培根三明治。你永远都不会厌倦烹饪新事物！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner4.png\" alt=\"Videos\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zI8exTF2BWU?si=WZGrt7raBliqzZM0\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wLPe06mfa2o?si=d4BoYRMJkv6gIEu7\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d4s0Jv7bzJ4?si=6SCOEBNS9d7N5E69\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/m13y55879fe.png\" alt=\"Credits\"></p>\n<p><strong>Allone</strong> (allone_the_duck)，<em>Allone's Additions</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnotsocobblemon-allones-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/notsocobblemon-allones-additions</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ASHISK</strong> (ashisk)，<em>Ashimons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fashimons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/ashimons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>BeeZy</strong> (beezymc)，<em>LackingMons</em> 的创作者之一</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/lackingmons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>BifeSalgado</strong> (BifeSalgado)，<em>OdysseyMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fodysseymons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/odysseymons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bwavii</strong> (bwavi)，<em>WaviMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwavimons-(cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/wavimons-(cobblemon</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>El Pigeon</strong> (elpigeon)，<em>Pigeon's PokePack</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpigeons-poke-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/pigeons-poke-pack</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Genotype</strong> (genotypexd)，<em>GenoMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgenomons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/genomons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>iMystxc</strong> (iMystxc)，<em>MysticMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmysticmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/mysticmons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>IZetyXX</strong> (izetyxx)，<em>LackingMons</em> 的创作者之一</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/lackingmons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Kale</strong> (kylbrez)，<em>Kale's Collection</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fkales-cobblemon-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/kales-cobblemon-collection</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>LegenTM</strong> (legentm)，<em>HiddenMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhiddenmons-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/hiddenmons-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>NetImmerse</strong> (netimmerse)，<em>The Jewel Pokemon</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fthe-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/the-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Raspix</strong> (raspix)，<em>CobbleCats</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobble-cats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/cobble-cats</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>RedRibbon</strong> (redriibbon)，<em>MissingMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmissingmons-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/missingmons-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Salt</strong> (saltdan)，<em>SaltMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsaltmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/saltmons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>YaBoiBruno</strong> (Bruno22)，<em>MoreMons</em> 的创作者</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmoremons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/moremons</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B5YQsgSZbR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner3.png\" alt=\"Join the Discord!\"></a></p>",
